  "recap": "The Base Invaders put together a strong offensive night on Thursday, August 27 but came up just short, falling 18–16 to the Chickadees in a back-and-forth battle. The bats were far from the problem, as the team racked up 24 hits and got 9 different players on base, but the Chickadees answered nearly every rally to keep the margin at two. Shane was the offensive engine, going a perfect 5-for-5 with 5 RBI, while Jason backed him up with a 4-for-5 night and 3 RBI. Trevor chipped in a clean 3-for-3, and Erik and Greg each drove in a pair of runs, finishing 2-for-4 and 2-for-5 respectively. With this much production up and down the lineup, the Base Invaders will look to turn a few more of these hits into runs and flip the result next time out.",
